out for FREE!\n\nSeven categories to explore. Over 1 Million in app five-star ratings!\n\n**NEW: The Fear Arena is open. Safe scares, big feelings and a lot of fun.**\n{1607277817804674}\n\nMake sure you try **Samsara** in the Awe Arena\n{1040915533978887}\n\nReduce anxiety, meditate, breathe or grab a pillow to lie down and sleep. Try hypnosis to distract you from pain and reduce stress. \n{1208055313831116}\n\nPlay exciting casual games and other interactive content. Liminal is much more than a mindfulness app:\n{828649595813485}\n\n**Experience Awe. Find Relief. Enhance your Focus. Face your Fears.**\n\nLiminal is a great way to chill out and have some fun!\n\nSubscribe for unlimited access. Or enjoy a weekly rotation of FREE experiences. \n\n- \"Incredible, Beautiful, and Jaw Dropping\u201d\n- \u201cAmazing and relaxing!\u201d\n- \u201cMakes the oculus worth it\u201d\n\nDesigned with neuroscientists and psychologists and a community of partners.  \n\nTake your first steps and try **Cyberpunch, Hypnosis, Iris** and more!\n\nThere is always plenty to try with Liminal!", "short_description": "155+ experiences to WOW you and transform your mood. Try our extensive catalog for FREE!\n\nNEW: The Fear Arena is open. Safe scares, big feelings and a lot of fun.\n\nSeven categories to explore. Over 1m in app five-star ratings!\n\nExperience Awe. Find Relief. Enhance your Focus. Face your Fears.\n\nLiminal is a great way to chill out and have fun!\n\nSubscribe for unlimited access. Or enjoy a free weekly rotation  of experiences. \n\nDesigned with neuroscientists and psychologists and content partners."}]}, "developer_name": "Liminal VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminalvr.com/privacy-statement/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://liminalvr.com/terms-conditions/", "publisher_name": "Liminal VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://liminalvr.com/liminal-platform/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfor